 border-stone-200 space-y-1.5\">\n      <div class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 flex justify-between\">\n        <span>♨️ 温泉・浴室設備</span>\n        <span class=\"text-amber-700\">★4.78</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 text-xs\">泉質: 単純温泉 / 露天風呂・家族風呂・天然温泉</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 space-y-1.5\">\n      <div class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 flex justify-between\">\n        <span>🍽️ 食事・グルメ</span>\n        <span class=\"text-orange-700\">朝★5 夕★5</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 text-xs\">朝食は地元の食材を活かしたビュッフェ、夕食は季節の会席料理をご用意（プランにより異なります）。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 space-y-1.5\">\n      <div class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 flex justify-between\">\n        <span>🚗 アクセス＆立地</span>\n        <span class=\"text-emerald-700\">★4.83</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 text-xs\">JR佐世保線武雄温泉駅／長崎自動車道武雄北方ICより7分</p>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-500 text-2xs\">有り　10台　無料</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 space-y-1.5\">\n      <div class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 flex justify-between\">\n        <span>⏰ チェックイン＆衛生面</span>\n        <span class=\"text-blue-700\">清潔感★4.67</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 text-xs\">IN 15:00〜 / OUT 〜10:00 (7室)</p>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-500 text-2xs truncate\">レストラン・喫茶・露天風呂・自動販売機・バーベキューガーデン・送迎バス</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n  <a href=\"/prefectures/saga/\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n    🎌 佐賀県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n   